 ----------------------------------------------------------------------
           Additional tools included in the AENET package
 ----------------------------------------------------------------------

 This directory contains additional tools, such as converters, that are
 specific to the AENET package.

 Available tools:

   fingerprint.f90     Compute the structural fingerprints

   neighbors.f90       Find all atoms within a specified range from a
                       reference atom.

   trnset2ASCII.f90    Conversion of binary training set files to an
                       ASCII format.

   trnset_info.f90     Print basic information about training set file
                       (number of structures, elements, and, if
                       normalized, energy stats)

